$$S_6 = \frac{364}{729}$$
Check if $364$ has factors of $3$. Sum of digits of $364$ is $3 + 6 + 4 = 13$. It is not divisible by $3$.
Since $729 = 3^6$, we only need to check divisibility by $3$. It isn't divisible. So this fraction is likely in simplest form.

